{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21037","headline":"假龙吟歌 · 李贺","name":"假龙吟歌","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"石轧铜杯，吟咏枯瘁。\n苍鹰摆血，白凤下肺。\n桂子自落，云弄车盖。\n木死沙崩恶谿岛，阿母得仙今不老。\n窞中跳汰截清涎，隈壖卧水埋金爪。\n崖蹬苍苔吊石发，江君掩帐篔簹折。\n莲花去国一千年，雨後闻腥犹带铁。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李贺","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_21037.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21037","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}